From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 14:36:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Replace emoji with SVG line icons across the entire app
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Roll out the src/ui/icons.js line-icon system (established in the
ClientView/WaterTracker preview) to every remaining reachable
client and trainer/admin screen: TrainingPackages, WorkoutView,
ClientStats, StepsTracker, SleepTracker, MotivationalCard,
BookingClient, DailyCheckin, ProgressPhotos, StreakBadge,
PushNotifications, Photouploadprompt, Onboarding, AdminPanel,
BookingAdmin, WorkoutPlanBuilder, WorkoutPresets,
ClientMeasurements, TrainerStats, ProgressCompare, PackageAdmin.

Also:
- Redraws the water glass's internal checkmark as a vector path
  instead of a text glyph, for full consistency with the rest of
  the fill animation.
- Swaps the confetti-burst particle from an emoji glyph to a small
  colored vector spark.
- Fixes a leftover empty-checkbox emoji in AdminPanel's exercise
  log list.

FoodLog.js, RecipeSuggestion.js, CheckIn.js, FoodSearch.js,
BarcodeScanner.js and WorkoutTracker.js are untouched — none of
them are imported/reachable from the app.
